### 1. GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

### 2. Create a new Employee (Valid POST)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ram",
  "lastName": "Reddy",
  "email": "ram1@gmail.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-12-09",
  "salary": 45000.00,
  "employeeStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "joinDate": "2026-11-09"
}

### 3. Partial Update Employee (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employee/b9db36cc-310a-4feb-b562-3ebf27f2d180
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ram.updated@gmail.com",
  "salary": 65000.00
}

### 4. Full Update Employee (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/employee/b9db36cc-310a-4feb-b562-3ebf27f2d180
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Ram Kumar",
  "lastName": "Reddy",
  "email": "ram.reddy@gmail.com",
  "dateOfBirth": "2004-12-09",
  "salary": 50000.00,
  "employeeStatus": "ACTIVE",
  "joinDate": "2026-11-09"
}

